<section id="Ch0.Sx1" class="ltx_section">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_section">Declaration</h3>

<div id="Ch0.Sx1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ch0.Sx1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">I declare that the work presented in this dissertation is, to the best of my knowledge and belief, original and my own work. The material has not been submitted, either in whole or in part, for a degree at this, or any other university. 
<br class="ltx_break"></p>
</div>
<div id="Ch0.Sx1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Ch0.Sx1.p2.1" class="ltx_p">Name: <span id="Ch0.Sx1.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Andrejs Sorstkins</span> 
<br class="ltx_break">Date: <span id="Ch0.Sx1.p2.1.2" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\monthyeardate</span><span id="Ch0.Sx1.p2.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">August 24, 2026</span></p>
</div>
<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
<div id="Ch0.Sx1.1" class="ltx_logical-block">
      
<div id="Ch0.Sx1.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ch0.Sx1.p3.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center"><span id="Ch0.Sx1.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Diagnostics of cognitive failures in multi-agent expert systems using dynamic evaluation protocols and subsequent mutation of the processing context</span></p>
<p id="Ch0.Sx1.p3.2" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">Andrejs Sorstkins, BSc (Hons) Computer Science.</p>
<p id="Ch0.Sx1.p3.3" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">School of Computing and Communications, Lancaster University</p>
<p id="Ch0.Sx1.p3.4" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">A dissertation submitted for the degree of <span id="Ch0.Sx1.p3.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Master of Science</span> in Data Science

<br class="ltx_break"><span id="Ch0.Sx1.p3.4.2" class="ltx_ERROR undefined">\monthyeardate</span>August 24, 2026</p>
</div>
    
